{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"mukul975--anthropic-cybersecurity-skills--detecting-serverless-function-injection","name":"detecting-serverless-function-injection","description":"Detects and prevents code injection attacks targeting serverless functions (AWS Lambda, Azure Functions, Google Cloud Functions) through event source poisoning, malicious layer injection, runtime command execution, and IAM privilege escalation via function modification. The analyst combines static analysis of function code, CloudTrail event correlation, runtime behavior monitoring, and IAM policy auditing to identify injection vectors across the expanded serverless attack surface including API Gateway, S3, SQS, DynamoDB Streams, and CloudWatch event triggers. Activates for requests involving Lambda security assessment, serverless injection detection, function event poisoning analysis, or serverless privilege escalation investigation.","category":"Security","tags":["detecting","serverless","function","injection","detects","prevents","code","attacks","targeting","functions","aws","lambda","azure","google","cloud","through","event","source"],"repo":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","owner":"mukul975","stars":34277,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"Apache-2.0","licensePath":"skills/detecting-serverless-function-injection/LICENSE","revision":"54a798831d2266a3ca61ce68a7acb80b81160d57","path":"skills/detecting-serverless-function-injection","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills/tree/54a798831d2266a3ca61ce68a7acb80b81160d57/skills/detecting-serverless-function-injection","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:14:06.196Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-31T04:32:42Z","fileCount":4,"bytes":68071,"sha256":"48437c12b9fb2d0b5ec2fa1ef29625e91abef9253b107ccdfe77dae03d932a71","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"LICENSE","sourcePath":"skills/detecting-serverless-function-injection/LICENSE","bytes":11255,"sha256":"a941b58ef0ba43a31e24ae7ece1b743a585efed9e37792b9ca063e0798be1